}", "reasoning_content": "Okay, let's tackle this dilemma. So, the situation is that my best friend is desperate the night before a crucial exam. They didn't study and want me to help them cheat. If I help, I risk losing everything I've worked for, but if I don't, they might fail. Hmm.

